<main class="home-page">
  <header class="home-header">
    <div class="home-brand">
      <img src="/images/logos/PU.jpg" alt="University of the Punjab" class="home-brand-logo" />
      <span>
        <strong>CampusTree</strong>
        <small>Campus vegetation explorer</small>
      </span>
    </div>
    <span class="home-institution">CGIS · SCD · UNIVERSITY OF THE PUNJAB · LAHORE</span>
  </header>

  <section class="home-hero">
    <div class="home-hero-content">
      <span class="home-eyebrow">CAMPUS VEGETATION INVENTORY</span>
      <h1>Discover the campus canopy.</h1>
      <p>
        Explore the distribution of inventoried trees across the University of the
        Punjab through an interactive map built for campus discovery.
      </p>
      <a class="home-primary-link" href={~p"/"}>
        Explore the map <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <aside class="home-overview-card" aria-label="About the CampusTree inventory">
      <div class="home-overview-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none">
          <path
            d="M24 5v37M24 12c-1-7-8-9-13-6 0 7 5 11 13 11M24 21c2-8 9-11 15-8 0 7-6 13-15 14M24 29c-2-6-8-8-13-5 0 6 5 10 13 10"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2.5"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <span class="home-card-eyebrow">THE INVENTORY</span>
      <h2>Record of Botanical Garden Species</h2>
      <p>
        Tree locations and species information come together to offer a clearer
        picture of the university’s botanical garden.
      </p>
      
      <a class="home-location-link" href={~p"/"}>
        View Botanical Garden <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section class="home-highlights" aria-labelledby="home-highlights-title">
    <div class="home-section-heading">
      <span class="home-eyebrow">A CLOSER LOOK</span>
      <h2 id="home-highlights-title">What the inventory brings together</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="home-card-grid">
      <article class="home-feature-card">
        <div class="home-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</div>
        <h3>Tree locations</h3>
        <p>Geographic point locations show where inventoried trees are found across campus.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="home-feature-card">
        <div class="home-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</div>
        <h3>Species details</h3>
        <p>Scientific and local names, family, site, and area add context to each record.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="home-feature-card">
        <div class="home-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</div>
        <h3>Campus context</h3>
        <p>Map layers help relate individual tree records to their surrounding campus areas.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="home-feature-card home-coming-soon-card">
        <span class="home-coming-soon-badge">
          <span class="home-status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Coming soon
        </span>
        <div class="home-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</div>
        <h3>More university datasets</h3>
        <p>
          Campus vegetation datasets from other universities will be added soon.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="home-feature-card home-coming-soon-card">
        <span class="home-coming-soon-badge">
          <span class="home-status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Coming soon
        </span>
        <div class="home-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</div>
        <h3>Biomass insights</h3>
        <p>
          Biomass estimates and related insights will be added to the campus
          inventory soon.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="home-footer">
    <span>CampusTree · University of the Punjab</span>
    <span>Centre for Geographical Information System · Smart Sensing for Climate and Development · PU</span>
  </footer>
</main>
